{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/javascript/생성자_함수/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<p>Using function to create objects</p>\n<h2 id=\"생성자-함수로-객체-만들기\" style=\"position:relative;\">생성자 함수로 객체 만들기<a href=\"#%EC%83%9D%EC%84%B1%EC%9E%90-%ED%95%A8%EC%88%98%EB%A1%9C-%EA%B0%9D%EC%B2%B4-%EB%A7%8C%EB%93%A4%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"생성자 함수로 객체 만들기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>this 키워드를 통해서 property를 세팅할 수 있다.<br>\n생성자 함수로 객체를 만들 때는 꼭 ‘new’ 키워드를 사용해야 한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">IdolModel</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> year</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>year <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> year<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  \r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function-variable function\">dance</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token template-string\"><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">${</span><span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name<span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">이 춤을 춥니다.</span><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\">// new 키워드로 호출</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> yuJin <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">IdolModel</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'안유진'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">2003</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\nconsole<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>yuJin<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token comment\">// IdolModel { name: '안유진', year: 2003 }</span>\r\n\r\nconsole<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>yuJin<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">dance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token comment\">// 안유진이 춤을 춥니다.</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"new-키워드를-안쓰면-어떻게-될까\" style=\"position:relative;\">‘new’ 키워드를 안쓰면 어떻게 될까?<a href=\"#new-%ED%82%A4%EC%9B%8C%EB%93%9C%EB%A5%BC-%EC%95%88%EC%93%B0%EB%A9%B4-%EC%96%B4%EB%96%BB%EA%B2%8C-%EB%90%A0%EA%B9%8C\" aria-label=\"new 키워드를 안쓰면 어떻게 될까 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>undefined가 출력된다.<br>\n‘new’ 키워드 없이 함수형으로 실행 하면, 실행된 함수의 반환값이 없기 때문에 undefined가 출력된다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token comment\">// 일반 함수로 호출</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> yuJin2 <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">IdolModel</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'안유진'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">2003</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\nconsole<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>yuJin2<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n<span class=\"token comment\">// undefined</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"그렇다면-thisname과-thisyear는-어디로-갔을까\" style=\"position:relative;\">그렇다면, this.name과 this.year는 어디로 갔을까?<a href=\"#%EA%B7%B8%EB%A0%87%EB%8B%A4%EB%A9%B4-thisname%EA%B3%BC-thisyear%EB%8A%94-%EC%96%B4%EB%94%94%EB%A1%9C-%EA%B0%94%EC%9D%84%EA%B9%8C\" aria-label=\"그렇다면 thisname과 thisyear는 어디로 갔을까 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>global이라는 객체가 존재하는데, global은 자동으로 생성되는 객체이고, node에서 실행될 때 필요한 값들을 모두 들고있다.<br>\n(만약 웹에서 실행한다고 하면 window Object와 똑같은 것이다.)</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\">console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>global<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token comment\">// 안유진</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"new-키워드를-쓰게-되면-this를-어디에-매핑하는지를-결정하게-된다\" style=\"position:relative;\">new 키워드를 쓰게 되면 this를 어디에 매핑하는지를 결정하게 된다.<a href=\"#new-%ED%82%A4%EC%9B%8C%EB%93%9C%EB%A5%BC-%EC%93%B0%EA%B2%8C-%EB%90%98%EB%A9%B4-this%EB%A5%BC-%EC%96%B4%EB%94%94%EC%97%90-%EB%A7%A4%ED%95%91%ED%95%98%EB%8A%94%EC%A7%80%EB%A5%BC-%EA%B2%B0%EC%A0%95%ED%95%98%EA%B2%8C-%EB%90%9C%EB%8B%A4\" aria-label=\"new 키워드를 쓰게 되면 this를 어디에 매핑하는지를 결정하게 된다 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ol>\n<li>new 키워드로 호출한 1번 에서 this 는 자신이 된다. ==> IdolModel { }</li>\n<li>new 키워드 없이 호출한 2번에서는 this가 global에 매핑되었다.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">IdolModel</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> year</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>year <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> year<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  \r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function-variable function\">dance</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token template-string\"><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">${</span><span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name<span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">이 춤을 춥니다.</span><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\">// 1) new 키워드로 호출</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> yuJin <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">IdolModel</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'안유진'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">2003</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token comment\">// IdolModel {}</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\">// 2) 일반 함수로 호출</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> yuJin2 <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">IdolModel</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'안유진'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">2003</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token comment\">// &lt;ref *1> Object [global] { ...</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"newtarget으로-new-키워드-사용-여부를-알-수-있다\" style=\"position:relative;\">new.target으로 new 키워드 사용 여부를 알 수 있다.<a href=\"#newtarget%EC%9C%BC%EB%A1%9C-new-%ED%82%A4%EC%9B%8C%EB%93%9C-%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9-%EC%97%AC%EB%B6%80%EB%A5%BC-%EC%95%8C-%EC%88%98-%EC%9E%88%EB%8B%A4\" aria-label=\"newtarget으로 new 키워드 사용 여부를 알 수 있다 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ol>\n<li>new 키워드로 호출한 1번에서 new.target은 [Function: IdolModel]이 된다.</li>\n<li>new 키워드 없이 호출한 2번에서는 undefined가 출력되었다.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">IdolModel</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> year</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">new</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>target<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>year <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> year<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  \r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function-variable function\">dance</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token template-string\"><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">${</span><span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name<span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">이 춤을 춥니다.</span><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\">// 1) new 키워드로 호출</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> yuJin <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">IdolModel</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'안유진'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">2003</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token comment\">// [Function: IdolModel]</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\">// 2) 일반 함수로 호출</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> yuJin2 <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">IdolModel</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'안유진'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">2003</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token comment\">// undefined</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"new-키워드로-호출하지-않았을-때-new-키워드로-호출하도록-변경해준다\" style=\"position:relative;\">new 키워드로 호출하지 않았을 때 new 키워드로 호출하도록 변경해준다.<a href=\"#new-%ED%82%A4%EC%9B%8C%EB%93%9C%EB%A1%9C-%ED%98%B8%EC%B6%9C%ED%95%98%EC%A7%80-%EC%95%8A%EC%95%98%EC%9D%84-%EB%95%8C-new-%ED%82%A4%EC%9B%8C%EB%93%9C%EB%A1%9C-%ED%98%B8%EC%B6%9C%ED%95%98%EB%8F%84%EB%A1%9D-%EB%B3%80%EA%B2%BD%ED%95%B4%EC%A4%80%EB%8B%A4\" aria-label=\"new 키워드로 호출하지 않았을 때 new 키워드로 호출하도록 변경해준다 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenod